    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="将Windows11右键菜单改为Windows10的样子"><a href="#将Windows11右键菜单改为Windows10的样子" class="headerlink" title="将Windows11右键菜单改为Windows10的样子"></a>将Windows11右键菜单改为Windows10的样子</h1><p>复制下面代码然后保存到一个<code>*.bat</code>文件里</p><p>然后右键以管理员身份运行</p><figure class="highlight bat"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bat">reg add &quot;HKCU\Software\Classes\CLSID\&#123;<span class="hljs-number">86</span>ca1aa0-<span class="hljs-number">34</span>aa-<span class="hljs-number">4</span>e8b-a509-<span class="hljs-number">50</span>c905bae2a2&#125;\InprocServer32&quot; /f /ve<br><span class="hljs-built_in">taskkill</span> /f /im explorer.exe &amp; <span class="hljs-built_in">start</span> explorer.exe<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="还原成Windows11样式"><a href="#还原成Windows11样式" class="headerlink" title="还原成Windows11样式"></a>还原成Windows11样式</h1><figure class="highlight bat"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bat">reg delete &quot;HKCU\Software\Classes\CLSID\&#123;<span class="hljs-number">86</span>ca1aa0-<span class="hljs-number">34</span>aa-<span class="hljs-number">4</span>e8b-a509-<span class="hljs-number">50</span>c905bae2a2&#125;&quot; /f<br><span class="hljs-built_in">taskkill</span> /f /im explorer.exe &amp; <span class="hljs-built_in">start</span> explorer.exe <br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
    
